'''Volume 3''' is the third and final volume published by [[Shogakukan]] compiling chapters from the {{MangaArc|Omega Ruby & Alpha Sapphire}} of the [[Pokémon Adventures]] manga created by [[Hidenori Kusaka]] and [[Satoshi Yamamoto]]. The chapters in this volume are collected directly from the magazine publication of Pokémon Adventures and were collected in the regular volumes once the {{MangaArc|X & Y}} had finished. 

